></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Bestiary Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"bestiaryclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Class</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mammal</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"bestiarylevel\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Difficulty</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Trivial\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Level_Trivial_80e58b.gif\" width=\"57\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occurrence\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occurrence</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Common\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Occurrence_Common_bbcd9e.gif\" width=\"46\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occurrence\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Charm Points</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5 <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Charm Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Charm_Icon_d968ed.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occurrence\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Kills to Unlock</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">250</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"attacktype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Behaviour</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span title=\"Creature attacks in melee range\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Logout Block Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Logout_Block_Icon_8f2784.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"bestiarylevel\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Soul Core</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Badger Soul Core\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Badger_Soul_Core_df1a2c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Immunity Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"paraimmune\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Paralysable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"senseinvis\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sense Invis</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Behavioural Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walksaround\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Walks Around</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Energy Field (Square)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading